CLAP2 Audio Scene Segmentation & Caption Retrieval
Copyright 2026 LAION contributors

This repository uses CLAP2 (LAION-AI/clap2), OpenCLIP
(mlfoundations/open_clip), and PyTorch. Model weights are downloaded from
pinned official laion/clap2-*-audioxl-s1B Hugging Face repositories.

The caption catalogs are derived from
laion/laion-audio-xl-caption-cluster-library, revision
e4407f1f39ecc05425c5664bb68d6d9a3fb0081c, using its CLAP2-M 100M-subset
cluster representatives and its Luna taxonomy paraphrases. Source audio
identifiers and taxonomy paths are preserved. This code license does not
relicense the source captions, taxonomy, model weights, or recordings.
Consult docs/indexes.md and the linked source cards for their provenance
and applicable terms. No source recordings are bundled.

The synthetic-scene.wav example is generated by scripts/make_example.py
and provided under the repository's Apache-2.0 license.

Taxonomy attribution: laion/audio-taxonomy-classifier, revision
dd45763a1988f8c6cbba37e88a95ab5bd7053366, and the taxonomy authors.
The vocal-burst classes originate in LAION-AI/voice-taxonomies under
CC-BY-4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The included
Luna sentences are paraphrases of these taxonomy labels and descriptions.
